    <string name="editor_center_hint">A short tap in the middle of the stick, without tilting it, triggers this binding (for example jump with Space). Dragging the stick never triggers it.</string>
    <string name="editor_center_sensitivity">Center: sensitivity</string>
    <string name="editor_center_tap_hint">A tap counts when the finger rests for less than the tap time and does not slide further than the tap limit from the center. While it can still be a tap, the camera does not move; after that the stick works as usual. Larger values = more reliable jump, but the camera starts later.</string>
