    <string name="editor_radial_bar_hint">Bar 1 = main bar, 2 = bottom left, 3 = bottom right, 4 = right, 5 = right 2, 6 to 8 = more bars. With the addon\'s data only occupied slots, otherwise all 12; symbols and keys come from WoW.</string>
    <string name="editor_radial_direction_hint">Automatic: the arc turns toward the middle of the screen (button at the top edge: down, left: right, right: left, in the corners diagonal), otherwise up; the center stays on the button. A fixed direction applies unless it runs out of the picture: then the next one that fits.</string>
    <string name="editor_radial_hint">Tapping and dragging on the button opens the radial menu; field 1 is at the left end of the arc, the others follow clockwise, from field 9 on a second ring outside.</string>
    <string name="editor_range_custom">Custom</string>
