    <string name="editor_template_help">Game menus: map, talents, professions, spellbook, bags, quests, character, group finder (with the icons from WoW). Attack: action bar 1, slots 1 to 8. Emotes: chat commands. Full WoW menu: all twelve buttons of the menu bar (character, spellbook, talents, professions, quests, achievements, guild, group finder, collections, adventure guide, bags, game menu) - this lets you hide the menu bar in the game. Part 2: social, chat channels, chat menu, map, housing. WoW menu rest: what the menu bar does not have (map, bags, social, reputation, currencies, PvP, raid, chat channels, chat menu, menu bar on/off).</string>
